      "target": "out-new/pkg-staging/build/native/win-arm64/v8jsi2.dll",
      "memberOf": [
        "default"
      ],
      "tool": "binskim",
      "ruleId": "BA2014",
      "createdDate": "2026-11-17 00:00:00Z",
      "justification": "BA2014 on win-arm64 v8jsi2.dll -- same root cause as the win-x64/win-x86 entries: buffer-less 'default constructor closure' thunks (??_F...) in upstream V8's vendored static libs. A false positive, not fixable without patching V8. Per-RID signature, hence a separate entry."
    },
