      "justification": "BA2014 on win-x64 libnode.dll -- the same compiler-generated, buffer-less V8 closure thunks as the existing v8jsi2.dll suppression. libnode.dll's Rust code, including the Rust standard library, is built with Microsoft Rust and is not listed. No stack protection is disabled in Node.js or v8-jsi code. Per-binary and per-RID signature."
